   "body": "Fixed on [fix/5264-signin-marker-complete](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/5264-signin-marker-complete), commit [ff0c385f](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/commit/ff0c385ff0eafdb0df5432549706838818866207), based on upstream `ed0ab567`.\n\nThe fixture published the marker filename as soon as `writeFileSync` opened it, before its contents were complete. The Go cancellation test could observe that name and read an empty string. The fixture now writes a temporary file in the same directory and renames it into place after the write. Production code and the original `AbortError` assertion are unchanged.\n\nA regression test intercepts the actual fixture write after opening the file and before writing its content. That event barrier makes the old fixture fail with an empty marker, without a sleep; it passes with atomic publication. A mutation publishing empty content also fails. Seven related tests pass with race detection, plugin vet/build and syntax/format checks pass, and I independently reran the new check plus `TestCancelledSignInEndsItsFetch`.\n\nNo full repository or native Windows/macOS run was performed. The package uses its existing testenv sandbox; the outer HOME/cache environment was not separately replaced. AI-assisted implementation and review.",
